/-
kvraft-udp's UDP transport's proofs (`notes/kvraft-udp-proof-plan.md`) and the kvraft proofs they
reach (the part `KvRaft/`, `notes/kvraft-part.md`), every proof applied to its callees' results: the
part's own, and raft-noax's, `durable`'s, lintest's, porcupine's and Perennial's linked results
(their `Link.lean`s, used as they are). The callees are read off each proof's binders; a proof
generic in kvraft's model parameters is linked at the store's (`etc/link_kvraft.py`'s docstring).
Generated by `etc/gen-link.py --kvraft-udp` -- do not edit by hand.

141 results, 141 of them with no hypothesis. The others take, as hypotheses, the specs no result
proves and the hypotheses of the linked results they use: none.

`#print axioms` on a result is its trust base.
-/
